{"title":"Retro","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"sup-400-in-1-games-handheld-retro-game-box","title":"SUP 400 in 1 Games\nHandheld Retro Game Box","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMain Features: Built-in 400 classic games Can be played on TV Rechargeable Lithium-ion battery and USB cable, 6 hours of continuous game play after full charge Small size and light weight, suitable for traveling Perfect gift for children, retro game lovers, collectors, etc. Specifications: Screen:3 Inch Languages: English, Chinese Games: 400 Battery type: rechargeable Lithium-ion battery Battery volume: 600mAh Charging mode: USB Working time: 6 hours after full charge\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"SUP","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":44787248693470,"sku":"","price":9.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":44787248726238,"sku":"","price":9.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":44787248759006,"sku":"","price":9.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":44787248791774,"sku":"","price":9.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Yellow","offer_id":44787248824542,"sku":"","price":9.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1708030851746.jpg?v=1708031089"},{"product_id":"classic-retro-game-console-with-621-8bit-games-hdmi-output","title":"Classic Retro Game Console with 621 8bit Games - HDMI Output","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eHDMI HD Display】: Connect to your TV or computer via HDMI and play hundreds of games instantly. Recall your childhood memories and make it easy to enjoy vivid and exciting video games on the big screen.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【THE BEST GIFT】：Mini classic game console can send friends, send girlfriends, send wives, send husbands, and share the joy of childhood with them. This would make a great holiday gift, birthday gift.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【621 BUILT-IN GAMES】:Retro game console HDMI is built-in 621 classic video games with Dual Controllers. This 8-bit gaming console Easy to operate - Great for retro action games.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【HOW TO USE】: This console is a HDMI output, Support 4K TV,easy to use, please make sure your screen has HDMI input port. Just use the charger to connect the game console to the power source, then connect to the TV via the HDMI cable, and then plug in the controller. Turn on the power and start the game immediately!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44787345916126,"sku":"","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1708031970509.jpg?v=1708032556"},{"product_id":"nintendo-wii-white-console","title":"Nintendo Wii White Console with 200+ Games","description":"\u003ch3\u003eWii Is A Unique Interactive Games System That Lets Everyone Play!\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJust pick up the Wii remote and a whole new way of playing is in your hands. Wii is a completely unique, interactive experience, all you have to do is move to play. Point, throw, swing, slash, turn, shake or twist, it's all possible with the Wii remote. Wii means fun for everyone, of any age or skill level.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44787366330590,"sku":"","price":120.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1708032960793.jpg?v=1708033294"},{"product_id":"rg36s-video-game-handheld-console-built-in-64gb-tf-card-3-5-inch-ips-screen-retro-linux-system-support-5400-classic-games-2-4g-wireless-gamepad-tv-monitor-connection","title":"R36S Video Game Handheld Console, Built-in 64GB TF Card, 3.5 Inch IPS Screen, Retro Linux System, Support 15000+ Classic Games, 2.4G Wireless Gamepad, TV, Monitor Connection","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe new r36s Open source handheld console Portable retro arcade game nostalgia 3d dual system handheld\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e. New upgraded handheld arcade, dual joystick design, support dozens of mainstream simulators, tens of thousands of games for you to play.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e2. Clear and bright IPS screen: With a 3.5-inch display and 640 x 480 resolution, you can see more details and beautiful scenes in the game.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e3. Upgrade L\/R buttons, real spring four L\/R keys on the back, combined with exquisite curvature and grip design, better release fingers to achieve a better game state.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e4. Support 10000+ classic games: The R36S console supports dozens of simulators, covering multiple types of games, such as adventure, action, racing, etc. It works with 20 simulators.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"RG36s","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":45778127683806,"sku":"","price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":45778127716574,"sku":"","price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"titl