 MAME, N64, and PS1, with built-in simulator for multiple classic gaming platforms\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDISPLAY \u0026amp; CONTROLS: 3.5-inch HD IPS screen with 640x480 resolution, ergonomic grip design, and responsive gaming buttons for comfortable play\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eBATTERY PERFORMANCE: 4000mAh built-in lithium battery providing 6 hours of gameplay, with 2-hour quick charging via Type-C port\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCONNECTIVITY OPTIONS: Features Type-C charging port, Type-C OTG support, and standard 3.5mm headphone interface for versatile connectivity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"R36 Pro","offers":[{"title":"Red","offer_id":47545542377694,"sku":null,"price":40.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47545542410462,"sku":null,"price":40.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":47545542443230,"sku":null,"price":40.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple","offer_id":47545542475998,"sku":null,"price":40.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":47545542508766,"sku":null,"price":40.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_62321d66-67c0-42fc-8db5-09071084126b.jpg?v=1758318991"},{"product_id":"2025-r36-max-4inch-ips-21000-games-video-handheld-game-players-4000mah-os-linux-system-hand-retro-game-console","title":"2026 R36 Max 4inch IPS 21000+ Games Video Handheld Game Players 4000mAh OS Linux System Hand Retro Game Console","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e The R36s Handheld Game Console, especially the R36 Max version, comes with an astonishing collection of up to 18000+ games. This powerhouse drives remarkable gaming. It breezes through countless 2D games and even some 3D ones, putting premium performance at your fingertips. Its slick processing means fluid gameplay, no hitches or slowdowns. Action, puzzles, it conquers all, rivaling bigger consoles.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eR36MAX Vibrant Visuals with 4 Inch IPS Screen: This2025 New Upgrade R36s 4-inch IPS screen is a real standout. resolution of 720*720 flaunts vibrant colors and razor-sharp visuals, instantly elevating your gaming fun. When you're embarking on epic adventures or engaging in high-speed chases, every scene comes to life vividly. The advanced display tech guarantees clear images, easing eye strain during long play. It's like a portal to a more engaging gaming realm, making each session a pleasure.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePower and Stability of Linux System: Operating on Linux, this console packs a punch. It combines raw power with stability and top-notch security. The Linux setup enables seamless multitasking and smart resource handling. Complex game maneuvers? No problem. Switch between apps and games smoothly. Plus, robust security shields your data and personal info. It's the bedrock of a reliable gaming spree.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExpansive Games Storage Options: With 64G internal storage, a world of games awaits. But there's more! Slot in a TF card to supercharge your collection. Love retro classics or indie gems? You'll never run dry. Ample space also speeds up game loading, slashing wait times and upping playtime.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePortable Design for On-the-Go Gaming: Built for mobility, this mini retro console is compact and light. The 4000mAh battery fuels up to 6 hours of play. Ideal for travels, queues, or home chilling. Its speakers sound great, and the 3.5mm jack offers private immersion. Take your games anywhere, relish uninterrupted fun.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"R36 Max","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47545537724638,"sku":null,"price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":47545537757406,"sku":null,"price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47545537790174,"sku":null,"price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":47545537822942,"sku":null,"price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple","offer_id":47545537855710,"sku":null,"price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_7e78f59c-a9be-4033-87b5-7b9e20956972.jpg?v=1758319937"},{"product_id":"m15-retro-game-stick-4k-hdmi-output-wireless-controller-plug-and-play-video-game-console-with-19000-games-arcade-game-console","title":"M15 Retro Game Stick, 4K HDMI Output \u0026 Wireless Controller Plug and Play Video Game Console with 19000+ Games, Arcade Game Console","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e☛ 𝑹𝒆𝒕𝒓𝒐 𝑮𝒂𝒎𝒆 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒐𝒍𝒆: Revisit your favorite classic games with this Retro Game Stick, supports 3P4P multiplayer games.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e☛ 𝑯𝒊𝒈𝒉-𝒅𝒆𝒇𝒊𝒏𝒊𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝑯𝑫𝑴𝑰 𝑶𝒖𝒕𝒑𝒖𝒕: Just plug and play. 4K TV monitors will be clearer. Allows you to easily enjoy lively and interesting video games on the big screen.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e☛ 𝑪𝒐𝒎𝒑𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒃𝒍𝒆 𝒘𝒊𝒕𝒉 𝒎𝒖𝒍𝒕𝒊𝒑𝒍𝒆 𝒔𝒊𝒎𝒖𝒍𝒂𝒕𝒐𝒓𝒔: Featuring high performance, low power consumption, fast program loading, smooth task processing, and fast game speed.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e☛ 𝑬𝒂𝒔𝒚 𝑶𝒑𝒆𝒓𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏: It allows to save and collect games, customize key settings, and expand ROM to download games. The plug-and-play feature provides game pausing, saving and archiveing functions.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e☛ 𝑾𝒊𝒓𝒆𝒍𝒆𝒔𝒔 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒏𝒆𝒄𝒕𝒊𝒗𝒊𝒕𝒚: Able to connect wireless wired gamepads, and up to four players online battle together. It is an ideal gift for kids and adults on birthdays or any occasion.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"M15","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47672288870622,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f1e6912b-3877-4225-ba4f-ce011118fdb5.jpg?v=1762981214"},{"product_id":"ma18-retro-game-stick-console-with-52-emulators-30-000-classic-games-including-gta-game","title":"MA18 Retro Game Stick Console, with 52 Emulators, 30,000+ Classic Games Including GTA Game","description":"\u003cp\u003eGAME LIBRARY: Massive collection of 30,000+ classic games including popular titles like GTA, NBA, Football \u0026amp; Smack down\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSTORAGE CAPACITY: 64GB internal storage to accommodate the extensive game library and save files\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEMULATOR SUPPORT: Features 52 different emulators allowing you to play games from various classic gaming platforms\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCOMPACT DESIGN: Sleek white gaming stick format for easy storage and portability while connecting to your display\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePLUG AND PLAY: Ready-to-use system with pre-loaded games and emulators for instant gaming entertainment\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Ma18","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47672309547230,"sku":null,"price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_d5c7ed1c-2871-41fa-b291-adc7d191bf0c.jpg?v=1762982249"},{"product_id":"gs5-mini-game-stick-console-30000-pre-installed-games-psp-games-compatible-53-simulators-including-gta-game","title":"GS5 Mini Game Stick Console, 30000 Pre-installed Games, PSP Games Compatible, 53 Simulators Including GTA Game","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience gaming nostalgia with the GS5 Mini Portable Game Console, a compact entertainment powerhouse that puts thousands of classic games at your fingertips. This versatile gaming device comes with an impressive 64GB storage capacity, pre-loaded with 30000 games including popular titles across various genres. The console supports PSP game formats and features 53 different gaming simulators, offering an extensive range of gaming possibilities. Whether you're a fan of action-packed adventures or classic arcade games, this portable console delivers hours of entertainment on the go. Its compact design makes it perfect for travel, while the built-in memory ensures you have plenty of gaming options without requiring additional storage. The intuitive interface makes it easy to navigate through your game library and start playing immediately. Ideal for both casual gamers and retro gaming enthusiasts who want to relive their favourite gaming moments or discover classic titles they might have missed.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eGAMING LIBRARY: Massive collection of 30000 pre-installed games including popular titles like GTA and Tekken for endless entertainment\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSTORAGE CAPACITY: 64GB built-in storage to accommodate your gaming collection and save files\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCOMPATIBILITY: Features 53 gaming simulators supporting PSP games and various other gaming platforms\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePORTABILITY: Compact mini console design perfect for gaming on-the-go with convenient handheld form factor\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eGAMING EXPERIENCE: Versatile gaming system offering diverse gameplay options across multiple gaming genres and platforms\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Gs5","offers":[{"title":"Red","offer_id":47672353456350,"sku":null,"price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47672353489118,"sku":null,"price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":47672353521886,"sku":null,"price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_b8059baa-d862-44b3-9ba2-14074296d4b7.jpg?v=1762982952"},{"product_id":"j36-ultra-handheld-game-console-3-5-inch-ips-screen-30-000-pre-loaded-games-with-wifi","title":"J36 Ultra Handheld Game Console 3.5 Inch IPS Screen 30,000+ Pre-loaded Games with Wifi","description":"\u003cp\u003eVibrant IPS Display: Features a 3.5-inch IPS screen with a 640 x 480 resolution. The IPS technology ensures wide viewing angles and vivid colors for retro titles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMassive Game Library: Comes preloaded with 30,000+ games on a 64GB microSD card. It supports over 20 emulator platforms, including:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConsoles: PSP, PS1, N64, NDS, Dreamcast, and Sega Saturn.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClassic Systems: Arcade (MAME\/NeoGeo), GBA, GBC, GB, NES, SNES, and Mega Drive.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomizable RGB Lighting: Equipped with dual analog joysticks featuring RGB colorful lighting to enhance the gaming aesthetic.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMultimedia \u0026amp; Connectivity: Unlike many basic retro handhelds, it supports built-in YouTube and global online multiplayer through integrated 5G Wi-Fi and Bluetooth 4.2.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExtended Battery Life: A 3000mAh rechargeable lithium battery provides between 5 to 8 hours of continuous gameplay.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePowerful Internals: Powered by an 8-core ARM Cortex-A7 processor (up to 2.0GHz) and 1GB of RAM for smooth emulation performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eErgonomic Controls: Includes a full button layout with dual 3D joysticks, a D-pad, ABXY buttons, and shoulder triggers (L1\/L2, R1\/R2).\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"J36","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":48268858065118,"sku":null,"price":38.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48268858097886,"sku":null,"price":38.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":48268858130654,"sku":null,"price":38.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple","offer_id":48268858163422,"sku":null,"price":38.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_ebfe690a-766c-445a-9c81-14392ca705c7.jpg?v=1779307892"},{"product_id":"m66-retro-game-stick-console-4k-mini-arcade-64-gb-with-30-emulator-20000-gta-donkey-kong-tekken-etc","title":"M66 Retro Game stick Console 4K Mini Arcade 64 GB with 30+ Emulator, 20000+GTA, Donkey Kong, Tekken etc.,","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eARCADE GAME CONSOLE: Handheld gaming console with detachable controllers in red and blue colours, designed for portable and versatile gaming experience\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEXTENSIVE GAME LIBRARY: Includes more than 30 built-in emulators providing access to a wide variety of classic arcade games for endless entertainment\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDUAL CONTROLLER GRIP: Comes with ergonomic grip attachment that holds both controllers together, creating a comfortable traditional gamepad configuration for extended play sessions\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCONNECTIVITY CABLES INCLUDED: Package includes USB Type-C charging cable and HDMI cable for connecting the console to TV screens for larger display gaming\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePORTABLE DESIGN: Compact and lightweight handheld design allows you to take your gaming anywhere, perfect for travel or gaming on the go\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Gamers Stop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48268889030878,"sku":null,"price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_6eabe4c7-4500-4fe2-bd8d-1ebcc5b863ad.jpg?v=1779308794"},{"product_id":"m18-pro-retro-handheld-game-console-21-000-games-with-controller-combo-plays-handheld-and-on-tv","title":"M18 Pro Retro Handheld Game Console: 21,000+ Games with Controller Combo. Plays handheld and on TV","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe M18 Pro delivers dual-mode gaming versatility, functioning seamlessly as both a handheld device and a connected TV console. Equipped with integrated controls and a comprehensive library of 10,000 games, it offers extensive entertainment across multiple genres and eras. The combo design eliminates the need for separate systems, making it an efficient solution for gamers seeking portability without sacrificing home console performance. Ideal for casual players and enthusiasts alike\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e4.3-inch IPS display with 480×272 pixels resolution\u003cbr\u003e10000+ GAMES PRELOADED ON BOARD\u003cbr\u003eProcessor RK3566\u003cbr\u003eBuilt-in 3500mAh lithium battery, with a range of up to 4 hours of play.\u003cbr\u003eMemory expandable up to 64GB\u003cbr\u003eSupports an HDMI output for connection to a TV or screen, as well as wireless connection for the supplied controls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging cable and HDMI 1.5m cable included.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Gamers Stop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48269119684830,"sku":null,"price":40.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_b3321a3a-1e4e-4bde-bd17-7c4ae17844c2.jpg?v=1779309771"},{"product_id":"gs5-pro-retro-game-console-4k-ultra-hd-with-built-in-30000-games-gam-53-emulators","title":"GS5 PRO Retro Game Console 4K Ultra HD with Built-in 30000 + Games \u0026  Gam  | 53 Emulators","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e30,000+ Games | Dual Wireless Controllers | PSP Emulator | Mini PS5 Design | Plug \u0026amp; Play TV Game Console\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🎮 Mini PS5-Style Gaming Console for TV\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GS5 Pro Gaming Console comes with a mini PS5-inspired design, offering a modern look while delivering powerful retro gaming performance. Perfect for kids, adults, and family entertainment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🕹️ Dual Wireless Controllers with USB Receiver\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes 2 wireless joysticks with a USB receiver for stable, lag-free connectivity. Enjoy smooth gameplay, multiplayer fun, and comfortable control for long gaming sessions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🎯 30,000+ Preloaded Games\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlay 30,000+ classic and retro games without downloading or installing anything. This console supports 52 built-in emulators, giving access to multiple gaming platforms in one device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🔥 PSP Games Included\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy popular PSP emulator games such as:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGTA Vice City,Tekken 6, WWE Games\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMany more action, racing, and adventure titles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003ePlug \u0026amp; Play Gaming Console\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a plug and play TV gaming console—just connect via HDMI, insert the USB receiver, and start playing instantly. No internet connection required.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥️ \u003cstrong\u003eHDMI Output – Supports Modern TVs\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatible with LED, LCD, Smart TVs, and monitors, delivering smooth HD visuals for an enhanced retro gaming experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Gamers Stop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48269392904414,"sku":null,"price":45.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_0d2a4e30-13b6-40a8-a9b9-7d2a01323e73.jpg?v=1779310665"},{"product_id":"f","title":"R36 Max 2 Handheld Game Console 4.5 Inch Linux System 4000mah Supports Wifi 30+simulators 18500+ Games Included","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"container\"\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"web_main page_main\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"layout\"\u003e\n\u003csection class