/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.game-gaga.com\/uploads\/R36MAX2-%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%AF%A6%E6%83%85%E5%9B%BE_%E8%8B%B1%E6%96%87_11.jpg\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-14573\" alt=\"R36MAX2-完整详情图_英文_11\" src=\"https:\/\/www.game-gaga.com\/uploads\/R36MAX2-%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E8%AF%A6%E6%83%85%E5%9B%BE_%E8%8B%B1%E6%96%87_11.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e64gb \/ 18500 games included\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4000mAh long battery life\u003cbr\u003eLarge battery capacity and long battery life,4-6 hours of continuous gaming on medium brightness.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4.5 INCH FULL-ADHESIVE SCREEN\u003cbr\u003eExperience the 1024*768 IPS display with full lamination. The anti-glare 2D glass ensures vivid colors, while the textured surface brings back that classic arcade feel.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRK3326 OPEN SOURCE LINUX SYSTEM\u003cbr\u003eRK3326 professional gaming chip is equipped with a 1.5Ghz 64-bit processor with the function of repairing system bugs, supporting 8-64-bit gaming systems and creating an exclusive game library.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSUPPORTS 30+ EMULATORS\u003cbr\u003eSupports 30+ mainstream emulator games Tens of thousands of games you want to play.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e360° COLORFUL MOOD LIGHTING\u003cbr\u003eDazzling gradient ambient light, 360-degree rotating colour change adds more fun to the game.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"R36 Max","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":49095913210078,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":49095913242846,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":49095913275614,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple","offer_id":49095913308382,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_9aac2991-1e7e-4884-bca0-4385bcf07d2d.jpg?v=1790114301"},{"product_id":"rf40h-handheld-retro-game-console-4-0-20-000-classic-games-open-source-linux-system-support-wifi-online-play","title":"RF40H Handheld Retro Game Console, 4.0\" 20,000+ Classic Games, Open Source Linux System, Support WiFi Online Play","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Massive Preloaded Game Library \u0026amp; Powerful Emulation】This RF40H retro handheld game console supports over 20 emulators and comes pre-installed with over 20,000 retro classic games, perfectly recreating the arcade and home console gaming experience. A high-performance quad-core processor ensures smooth gameplay, eliminating lag. Relive your nostalgic memories! NOTE: This product is not suitable for people under 12 year old.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Vibrant 4.0-Inch IPS Display for Immersive Play】Enjoy every pixel-perfect moment on the brilliant 4.0-inch IPS screen. Featuring a 720x720 high-definition resolution, wide viewing angles, and tempered glass protection, it delivers crisp, vibrant visuals with rich colors. Whether it's fast-paced action or detailed RPGs, the UYTGXEN retro game console handheld brings your gaming adventures to life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Supports WiFi for Connect \u0026amp; Compete】Our RF40H retro gaming console supports WiFi connectivity, allowing you to say goodbye to single-player games and enjoy online multiplayer battles with friends, or connect a wired controller for instant couch co-op gaming. Equipped with high-fidelity stereo speakers or a dedicated 3.5mm headphone jack, immerse yourself in a rich and dynamic audio experience, bringing every explosion and classic sound effect to life. Keep your hand held game console fresh and exciting.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Open-Source Linux System】Take control with the versatile open source Linux system. Tech-savvy users can customize the interface, add new emulators, and manage their game library with greater freedom. With 64GB of built-in storage, you can add your favorite ROMs anytime to create the ultimate personal game collection.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【All-in-One Portable Design \u0026amp; Long-Lasting Battery】Your perfect travel companion! Designed for ultimate portability, this sleek retro game console fits comfortably in your hands and slips into any bag. Fueled by a robust 4000mAh rechargeable battery, it delivers an impressive 6-8 hours of continuous gameplay on a single charge—perfect for long commutes, trips, or gaming sessions anywhere.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e【Complete Ready-to-Play Kit \u0026amp; Ideal Gift】Get everything you need to start playing immediately: 1x retro gaming console handheld, 1x 64GB TF card, 1x TYPE-C charging cable, 1x organizer bag, 1x screen film, and 1x user manual. No complicated setup required, it's ready to use right out of the box and easy to pick up. This game console is the perfect gift for gamers, retro game enthusiasts, and anyone seeking endless entertainment.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Gamers Stop","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":49096034746590,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":49096034779358,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":49096034812126,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_a637e549-f9c5-4030-b96e-31cc9bccbec1.jpg?v=1790115812"},{"product_id":"m28-retro-handheld-retro-game-console-30-emulators-emuelec-system-7-1-lcd-fhd-screen-4000mah-128gb-20000-games","title":"M28 Retro Handheld Retro Game Console,30+ Emulators, EmuELEC System,7.1″ LCD FHD Screen 4000mAh (128GB 20000+ Games)","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section hoc-custom-expander-heading-text\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"topHighlights-heading\" class=\"a-size-medium hoc-truncate-2-lines a-text-bold\"\u003eM28 Retro Handheld Gaming Console with 20,000+ Built in games and PS2 Support including GTA San Andreas Game\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"topHighlights-content\" aria-label=\"Top highlights--content\" class=\"a-section\" role=\"region\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"hoc-topHighlights-expander\" data-a-expander-name=\"topHighlights\" data-a-expander-collapsed-height=\"410\" class=\"a-expander-collapsed-height a-row a-expander-container a-spacing-base a-expander-partial-collapse-container hoc-topHighlights-see-more-collapsed-height\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-expanded=\"true\" class=\"a-expander-content a-spacing-none a-expander-partial-collapse-content a-expander-content-expanded\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDescription_hoc_feature_div\" class=\"celwidget\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDescription_hoc\" data-csa-c-type=\"widget\" data-csa-c-content-id=\"featureBulletsAndDescription_hoc\" data-csa-c-slot-id=\"featureBulletsAndDescription_hoc_feature_div\" data-csa-c-asin=\"\" data-csa-c-is-in-initial-active-row=\"false\" data-csa-c-id=\"sfqcs0-nns5i8-gsgzz5-zphau\" data-cel-widget=\"featureBulletsAndDescription_hoc_feature_div\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-mini\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e🎮 【supports over 30 classic emulators, relive childhood gaming memories】It comes with a variety of classic game emulators, covering multiple platforms and game types. The games are clearly classified and support search. It is portable and easy to use, allowing you to relive the joys of your childhood anytime and anywhere.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e🌈 【Jumping RGB rainbow light effect, the game atmosphere is maximized】 The controller is equipped with dynamic jumping RGB rainbow ambient lights, which change the lighting effect as the game interacts, enhancing the immersion and entertainment experience of the game and making every game full of passion.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e🎯 【dual-mode hall linear trigger, precise no drift】It adopts Hall linear triggers and joystick design, achieving precise control through electromagnetic induction. It has no physical wear, no drift, no slippage, and is highly responsive, making it suitable for competitive games.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e🖥️ 【4K ultra hd output, vivid picture details】Supports 4K ultra-high-definition video output, providing richer picture details and immersive visual experiences, allowing you to enjoy stunning game graphics on your TV or monitor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e📦 【Hidden stand + dual vibration motors, comfortable and long-lasting gaming】 The hidden adjustable Angle stand on the back frees up your hands, so you won't get tired even after long gaming sessions. Equipped with dual-vibration large motors, it enhances the game feedback and improves the realistic operation experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Gamers Stop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49096255144158,"sku":null,"price":95.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_bf9294ef-43f0-4afc-9dd7-17aff9b51fee.jpg?v=1790117765"}],"url":"https:\/\/www.gamers-stop.com\/collections\/retro.oembed","provider":"Gamers Stop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}